{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid47", "sentence_id": "s001", "text": "你好，今天的会议改到下午3点半开始。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.726, "n_samples": 89425, "proc_s": 1.1361, "rtf": 0.3049, "samples_sha256": "b297905635e957c2b2471ea2caeb9127e33a3b929bce8c4ee83a253b9cfaf052"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid47", "sentence_id": "s002", "text": "我刚买了一部新的iPhone，用起来很顺手。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 4.086, "n_samples": 98065, "proc_s": 1.3576, "rtf": 0.3323, "samples_sha256": "3cc15816eb645f7b6e4da1434c631984d022340bfd0981c8bf82004673610727"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid47", "sentence_id": "s003", "text": "这件衣服打折以后只要128元。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.011, "n_samples": 72261, "proc_s": 0.8796, "rtf": 0.2921, "samples_sha256": "084103b971d8e947850a5f447a548d7bc8c23e1c5b1299f0ae340f685857e36d"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid47", "sentence_id": "s004", "text": "我们约在2026年10月20日见面吧。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.075, "n_samples": 73794, "proc_s": 0.9352, "rtf": 0.3042, "samples_sha256": "168cd66d8dd15ebbc5619725790f723021d2e2e05c0f85783c71cc9ee4e44e85"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid47", "sentence_id": "s005", "text": "请把报告在周五之前发给我。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 2.504, "n_samples": 60094, "proc_s": 0.8138, "rtf": 0.325, "samples_sha256": "a4b1bf5e37f13482c773019cbf8142b957cb9bc87e5683e1fecd5738b7b2d77a"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid47", "sentence_id": "s006", "text": "现在的AI工具越来越好用了。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 2.824, "n_samples": 67787, "proc_s": 0.9159, "rtf": 0.3243, "samples_sha256": "8b45a3b587162882498e56d02b65d304eb0632459ac3b32a1ca1d92182535a92"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid47", "sentence_id": "s007", "text": "你的航班几点起飞？我记得是早上8点20分。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 4.101, "n_samples": 98417, "proc_s": 1.252, "rtf": 0.3053, "samples_sha256": "3016ebc689afa8b5d847d4e9ed6a1a8ce2e584667fbbf3d38e6295463a961bdd"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid47", "sentence_id": "s008", "text": "这个月的电费一共是356块钱。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.177, "n_samples": 76246, "proc_s": 0.8419, "rtf": 0.265, "samples_sha256": "21644f82d794bc2d0f621b5e7fdb99e7e7c8fef7a3899a4e31d001c7a612eaf8"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid47", "sentence_id": "s009", "text": "我住在3楼，电梯就在门口右边。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.069, "n_samples": 73655, "proc_s": 0.9556, "rtf": 0.3114, "samples_sha256": "146980d59203aab792358d0c9e82c67aa1ffc7f9f4cbc47a1fc11bd673a4de9f"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid47", "sentence_id": "s010", "text": "他每天跑步5公里，已经坚持了两年。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.357, "n_samples": 80577, "proc_s": 1.0287, "rtf": 0.3064, "samples_sha256": "f4511cd6d1c84a1bfa1b19ea7c421bf98bf4b4d10cfa7cfee65d736f37dea20c"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid47", "sentence_id": "s011", "text": "下周一我们要去上海出差。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 2.368, "n_samples": 56827, "proc_s": 0.6686, "rtf": 0.2824, "samples_sha256": "cd5ef5f7dc453b9602b716599b8ccd60b4574d30fdd999858d607134100a2ee8"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid47", "sentence_id": "s012", "text": "你能帮我订一张明天去北京的高铁票吗？", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.263, "n_samples": 78303, "proc_s": 0.86, "rtf": 0.2636, "samples_sha256": "284458581bb6d9352b7d52b90164edc111243a21e85996809f6e2c904d1732f4"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid47", "sentence_id": "s013", "text": "这家餐厅的评分是4.8分，值得一试。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.551, "n_samples": 85220, "proc_s": 1.321, "rtf": 0.372, "samples_sha256": "92ef03a219d53dd71b4f76051e0aa75831d28135e12d7d79f657330789ead334"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid47", "sentence_id": "s014", "text": "我的手机号是13812345678，有事打给我。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 4.396, "n_samples": 105514, "proc_s": 1.2412, "rtf": 0.2823, "samples_sha256": "80088dee2c40fa9dc82f8f7f34016f48ae34234f2ecec60765d700492efcebc7"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid47", "sentence_id": "s015", "text": "今年公司的销售额增长了15%。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.415, "n_samples": 81962, "proc_s": 1.0525, "rtf": 0.3082, "samples_sha256": "932d0040c422f9e74d64e95878cce24e7dfe70c9253d4806f5f9a727ef853a6a"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid47", "sentence_id": "s016", "text": "孩子们放学以后在公园里踢足球。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 2.847, "n_samples": 68331, "proc_s": 0.792, "rtf": 0.2782, "samples_sha256": "1648bfe6005d2b1ee855d606f384f38e21366232dbea99e726e1bda69b0b993c"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid47", "sentence_id": "s017", "text": "我用微信给你转了2000块，记得查收。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.294, "n_samples": 79050, "proc_s": 1.0315, "rtf": 0.3132, "samples_sha256": "f29ea99febb262f14c49612418993f1cac8d8986e0e637b50b1ac889f3552f48"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid47", "sentence_id": "s018", "text": "天气预报说明天最高气温32度。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 2.918, "n_samples": 70025, "proc_s": 0.8054, "rtf": 0.2761, "samples_sha256": "ed962376f5fb7ede317e27c75e7a81ed0cc29935522ce6964ddf3da81ee3a971"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid47", "sentence_id": "s019", "text": "请问洗手间在哪里？", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 1.875, "n_samples": 44989, "proc_s": 0.5594, "rtf": 0.2984, "samples_sha256": "a99e5bcbe77940f3665ead7cd5c890fdad6de026fd4f51b7df8d6a527b4c31fc"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid47", "sentence_id": "s020", "text": "我们的Zoom会议链接已经发到群里了。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.374, "n_samples": 80988, "proc_s": 1.0306, "rtf": 0.3054, "samples_sha256": "7bd6ff50147f4a06940f9d6a670553b3b41632a9427d0aac3509f1d9b0625fa9"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid47", "sentence_id": "s021", "text": "这本书我看了一半，故事特别精彩。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.129, "n_samples": 75086, "proc_s": 0.9754, "rtf": 0.3118, "samples_sha256": "4e1c0646774abac395a97986039e1504dc326bbca7a69b9113e95a568b6583c2"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid47", "sentence_id": "s022", "text": "他的生日是5月4日，我们准备给他一个惊喜。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.764, "n_samples": 90329, "proc_s": 1.1136, "rtf": 0.2959, "samples_sha256": "38a8debbad489c15ccd30c400b99a5ef8d4ed2d12a81d0200aec0999e270ebd7"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid47", "sentence_id": "s023", "text": "从这里打车到机场大概需要40分钟。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.229, "n_samples": 77495, "proc_s": 0.8457, "rtf": 0.2619, "samples_sha256": "e7d139f5b52320d9f7f7fcfd8f76c37273d42fa9b59de7cf99388e7e9895f33c"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid47", "sentence_id": "s024", "text": "我刚下载了ChatGPT的新版本。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.643, "n_samples": 87439, "proc_s": 1.2395, "rtf": 0.3402, "samples_sha256": "e151c0b77267c8dd3d136dc83f99d786b773e4dbdee3052f62c322fe732bd1d6"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid47", "sentence_id": "s025", "text": "房租每个月涨了500元，真让人头疼。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.344, "n_samples": 80255, "proc_s": 1.0156, "rtf": 0.3037, "samples_sha256": "bb55fec9eb35e79d7c09da129022b8cfbdc32a98482429066f1ead68f3727c2e"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid47", "sentence_id": "s026", "text": "周末你想去看电影还是去爬山？", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 2.718, "n_samples": 65237, "proc_s": 0.7525, "rtf": 0.2768, "samples_sha256": "f3f25ae51b1967f9f3a6f9e8918d70f5c616a54157649d1240afecf9f68e38d6"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid47", "sentence_id": "s027", "text": "这台笔记本电脑的价格是6999元。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.818, "n_samples": 91624, "proc_s": 1.0018, "rtf": 0.2624, "samples_sha256": "f5de70c8551f11855f02a6f0d282a2dd3d97cfa4ce900bf0ed1f10c02c6785d0"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid47", "sentence_id": "s028", "text": "医生建议我每天喝8杯水。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 2.272, "n_samples": 54520, "proc_s": 0.7115, "rtf": 0.3132, "samples_sha256": "4d9a4dc50aa88aebd450c1a50097aa907380ad5eba259699dd7ac4f31738c79f"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid47", "sentence_id": "s029", "text": "我们团队一共有12个人，分成3个小组。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.589, "n_samples": 86125, "proc_s": 1.1272, "rtf": 0.3141, "samples_sha256": "0f3afc5af4afea28f91c2c027543797cb597dd0939afa019dc7a37d259d54e80"}
